To make this caching layer highly scalable and resilient, consider implementing distributed caching solutions like Redis or Memcached, which can be scaled horizontally to support thousands of concurrent requests. For adaptive cache eviction policies, integrate machine learning algorithms that analyze cache hit rates and adjust eviction thresholds dynamically. Implement robust logging and monitoring using frameworks like Prometheus and Grafana to track key performance metrics.

