To fully implement this service, you will need to provide concrete implementations for the `IAlertingFramework`, `IMonitoringProtocolFactory`, and various monitoring protocols (e.g., ICMP, TCP, HTTP/HTTPS). Additionally, you may want to add more features such as anomaly detection, cost-aware scheduling, security enhancements, compliance and auditing, and event-driven architecture.']

